From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 12:58:38 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] lane-302: IQ3_XXS gather batched grid init arm (opt-in
 GGML_ARIFI_IQ3XXS_INIT=1|2)

HQ81 order (relaunch-28 answer): the IQ3_S lever-6 init patch also on IQ3_XXS (10.77 ms per verify).
Spec 4 of mul_mat_vec_iq3_xxs.comp, idg pipelines only: 1 = all 4 of a thread's grid loads issue before any LDS store,
lane-interleaved (i0 + k*W + t), every entry written once = byte-identical by construction; 2 = planted wrong arm
(table rotated by one). Unset = 0 = legacy init_iq_shmem. Gather notice gains "iq3_xxs init N".
Cherry-pick name for lane 298: lane-302 IQ3_XXS gather init arm.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Origin: lane-302 (ArifiLabs native, fork-authored; no upstream origin)
Measured-effect: OPT-IN, default off. Op level cells/cellR-10061529-read.json (cache/moe-gather-x1-lane): IQ3_XXS batched init n2 +2.5/+2.1%, n4 +2.3/+8.3%, n8 +1.7/+1.9% slower, n1 +1.1/-1.3%; byte-identical (harness IDENT 3 arms), planted RED init=2 fails 9/10
